    "created_at": "2018-08-17T04:41:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-17T04:41:40Z",
    "body": "AFAIK, the idea to attempt to hide `window.event` in a shadow tree started at [Issue 334's comment](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/334#issuecomment-339541826).  I talked offline with Hayato and he shares the same concern with Anne, without having a strong motivation to hide `window.event` in a shadow tree no longer.\r\n\r\nI wasn't aware of this issue when we discussed Issue 334, and I'm now leaning to the idea to expose `window.event` regardless of a shadow tree.\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
