    "updated_at": "2018-08-17T07:15:43Z",
    "body": "FWIW, the latest betas of iOS 12 and macOS Mojave hides `window.event` when the target is in the shadow tree (matching behaviors of Firefox & Chrome in this regard for now). The change proposed by @annevk makes sense to me though.",
