    "created_at": "2018-08-17T10:33:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-17T10:33:35Z",
    "body": "We do adjust `e.target` (see https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-listener-invoke for details) during dispatch, but in the specific case of a shadow tree listener invoking a global function it will leak if either the global function already had access to `e` (capture listener) or gets it from `window.event`.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
