    "created_at": "2018-08-20T11:53:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-20T11:53:59Z",
    "body": "In case of a single developer that already has access to the shadow tree, hiding it indeed doesn't help.\r\n\r\nThe encapsulation comes into play with libraries not aware of the shadow trees reacting to UA-dispatched events or events dispatched by libraries aware of the shadow trees.",
